" stroke=""#F3F2F7"" stroke-width=""2""/><text x=""241.6"" y=""22.6"" text-anchor=""middle"" class=""axb"">14,54%</text><circle cx=""987.7"" cy=""239.1"" r=""4"" fill=""#C99A2E"" stroke=""#F3F2F7"" stroke-width=""2""/><text x=""987.7"" y=""256.1"" text-anchor=""middle"" class=""axb"">9,77%</text><circle cx=""1068.0"" cy=""208.4"" r=""4"" fill=""#C99A2E"" stroke=""#F3F2F7"" stroke-width=""2""/><text x=""1068.0"" y=""195.4"" text-anchor=""middle"" class=""axb"">10,49%</text><text x=""58.0"" y=""294"" text-anchor=""middle"" class=""ax"">2019</text><text x=""195.7"" y=""294"" text-anchor=""middle"" class=""ax"">2020</text><text x=""333.5"" y=""294"" text-anchor=""middle"" class=""ax"">2021</text><text x=""471.2"" y=""294"" text-anchor=""middle"" class=""ax"">2022</text><text x=""608.9"" y=""294"" text-anchor=""middle"" class=""ax"">2023</text><text x=""746.6"" y=""294"" text-anchor=""middle"" class=""ax"">2024</text><text x=""884.4"" y=""294"" text-anchor=""middle"" class=""ax"">2025</text><text x=""1068.0"" y=""294"" text-anchor=""middle"" class=""ax"">mai/26</text></svg><div class=""lg""><span><i class=""sw"" style=""background:#4B3B9E""></i>Cotas ativas (área)</span><span><i class=""sw"" style=""background:#C99A2E""></i>Inadimplência % (linha, eixo à direita)</span><span style=""color:#6B6A80"">Sombreado: choque da pandemia</span></div></div><div class=""sp""></div><div class=""eb"">Ato 02 · a troca de liderança</div><h1 class=""sf"">Moto ainda manda. <em>Imóvel é quem cresce.</em></h1><p class=""ld"">Motocicletas continua sendo metade do mercado, mas perdeu <b>9,2 pontos de share</b> desde 2019. Quem ocupou o espaço foi <b>Imóveis</b>, de 13,2% para 23,6% da carteira, mais do que triplicou em cotas, de 995 mil para 3,13 milhões.</p><div class=""row""><div class=""cd"" style=""flex:1.45""><div class=""tt"">Composição da carteira ativa · % por segmento</div><h2 class=""sf"">Como o mix se reorganizou</h2><svg viewBox=""0 0 700 320"" xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/2000/svg""><line x1=""34"" x2=""652"" y1=""294.0"" y2=""294.0"" class=""gl""/><text x=""26"" y=""297.5"" text-anchor=""end"" class=""ax"">0%</text><line x1=""34"" x2=""652"" y1=""224.0"" y2=""224.0"" class=""gl""/><text x=""26"" y=""227.5"" text-anchor=""end"" class=""ax"">25%</text><line x1=""34"" x2=""652"" y1=""154.0"" y2=""154.0"" class=""gl""/><text x=""26"" y=""157.5"" text-anchor=""end"" class=""ax"">50%</text><line x1=""34"" x2=""652"" y1=""84.0"" y2=""84.0"" class=""gl""/><text x=""26"" y=""87.5"" text-anchor=""end"" class=""ax"">75%</text><line x1=""34"" x2=""652"" y1=""14.0"" y2=""14.0"" class=""gl""/><text x=""26"" y=""17.5"" text-anchor=""end"" class=""ax"">100%</text><path d=""M34.0,151.9L122.3,156.1L210.6,161.2L298.9,167.6L387.1,172.3L475.4,174.0L563.7,176.8L652.0,177.6L652.0,294.0L563.7,294.0L475.4,294.0L387.1,294.0L298.9,294.0L210.6,294.0L122.3,294.0L34.0,294.0Z"" fill=""#2B2B3A"" opacity="".93""/><text x=""658"" y=""239.3"" class=""axb"">41,6%</text><path d=""M34.0,71.3L122.3,75.4L210.6,82.5L298.9,89.9L387.1,94.6L475.4,98.4L563.7,106.0L652.0,108.1L652.0,177.6L563.7,176.8L475.4,174.0L387.1,172.3L298.9,167.6L210.6,161.2L122.3,156.1L34.0,151.9Z"" fill=""#4B3B9E"" opacity="".93""/><text x=""658"" y=""146.4"" class=""axb"">24,8%</text><path d=""M34.0,34.4L122.3,38.0L210.6,42.6L298.9,47.5L387.1,47.8L475.4,45.1L563.7,43.7L652.0,42.0L652.0,108.1L563.7,106.0L475.4,98.4L387.1,94.6L298.9,89.9L210.6,82.5L122.3,75.4L34.0,71.3Z"" fill=""#E3B23C"" opacity="".93""/><text x=""658"" y=""78.6"" class=""axb"">23,6%</text><path d=""M34.0,21.4L122.3,24.6L210.6,27.0L298.9,28.2L387.1,26.7L475.4,23.6L563.7,23.4L652.0,22.3L652.0,42.0L563.7,43.7L475.4,45.1L387.1,47.8L298.9,47.5L210.6,42.6L122.3,38.0L34.0,34.4Z"" fill=""#7F7FFF"" opacity="".93""/><text x=""658"" y=""35.7"" class=""axb"">7,0%</text><path d=""M34.0,18.4L122.3,20.3L210.6,20.6L298.9,19.7L387.1,19.1L475.4,17.1L563.7,16.9L652.0,16.9L652.0,22.3L563.7,23.4L475.4,23.6L387.1,26.7L298.9,28.2L210.6,27.0L122.3,24.6L34.0,21.4Z"" fill=""#C0453E"" opacity="".93""/><path d=""M34.0,14.0L122.3,14.0L210.6,14.0L298.9,14.0L387.1,14.0L475.4,14.0L563.7,14.0L652.0,14.0L652.0,16.9L563.7,16.9L475.4,17.1L387.1,19.1L298.9,19.7L210.6,20.6L122.3,20.3L34.0,18.4Z"" fill=""#C6C4D4"" opacity="".93""/><text x=""34.0"" y=""314"" text-anchor=""middle"" class=""ax"">&#8217;19</text><text x=""122.3"" y=""314"" text-anchor=""middle"" class=""ax"">&#8217;20</text><text x=""210.6"" y=""314"" text-anchor=""middle"" class=""ax"">&#8217;21</text><text x=""298.9"" y=""314"" text-anchor=""middle"" class=""ax"">&#8217;22</text><text x=""387.1"" y=""314"" text-anchor=""middle"" class=""ax"">&#8217;23</text><text x=""475.4"" y=""314"" text-anchor=""middle"" class=""ax"">&#8217;24</text><text x=""563.7"" y=""314"" text-anchor=""middle"" class=""ax"">&#8217;25</text><text x=""652.0"" y=""314"" text-anchor=""middle"" class=""ax"">&#8217;26</text></svg><div class=""lg""><span><i class=""sw"" style=""background:#2B2B3A""></i>Motocicletas</span><span><i class=""sw"" style=""background:#4B3B9E""></i>Automóveis</span><span><i class=""sw"" style=""background:#E3B23C""></i>Imóveis</span><span><i class=""sw"" style=""background:#7F7FFF""></i>Pesados</span><span><i class=""sw"" style=""background:#C0453E""></i>Serviços</span><span><i class=""sw"" style=""background:#C6C4D4""></i>Eletroeletrônicos</span></div></div><div class=""cd""><div class=""tt"">Variação de share de 2019 a 2026</div><h2 class=""sf"">Quem ganhou, quem perdeu</h2><svg viewBox=""0 0 430 320"" xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/2000/svg""><line x1=""200"" x2=""200"" y1=""12"" y2=""253"" stroke=""#E1DFE8""/><rect x=""200.0"" y=""18"" width=""135.0"" height=""24"" rx=""3"" fill=""#C99A2E""/><text x=""191"" y=""34.0"" text-anchor=""end"" class=""axb"">Imóveis</text><text x=""344.0"" y=""34.0"" text-anchor=""start"" class=""axb"" fill=""#4F6B22"">+10,4 p.p.</text><rect x=""200.0"" y=""59"" width=""30.4"" height=""24"" rx=""3"" fill=""#C99A2E""/><text x=""191"" y=""75.0"" text-anchor=""end"" class=""axb"">Pesados</text><text x=""239.4"" y=""75.0"" text-anchor=""start"" class=""axb"" fill=""#4F6B22"">+2,3 p.p.</text><rect x=""200.0"" y=""100"" width=""11.1"" height=""24"" rx=""3"" fill=""#C99A2E""/><text x=""191"" y=""116.0"" text-anchor=""end"" class=""axb"">Serviços</text><text x=""220.1"" y=""116.0"" text-anchor=""start"" class=""axb"" fill=""#4F6B22"">+0,9 p.p.</text><rect x=""193.2"" y=""141"" width=""6.8"" height=""24"" rx=""3"" fill=""#C0453E""/><text x=""209"" y=""157.0"" text-anchor=""start"" class=""axb"">Eletroeletrônicos</text><text x=""184.2"" y=""157.0"" text-anchor=""end"" class=""axb"" fill=""#C0453E"">-0,5 p.p.</text><rect x=""149.0"" y=""182"" width=""51.0"" height=""24"" rx=""3"" fill=""#C0453E""/><text x=""209"" y=""198.0"" text-anchor=""start"" class=""axb"">Automóveis</text><text x=""140.0"" y=""198.0"" text-anchor=""end"" class=""axb"" fill=""#C0453E"">-3,9 p.p.</text><rect x=""81.3"" y=""223"" width=""118.7"" height=""24"" rx=""3"" fill=""#C0453E""/><text x=""209"" y=""239.0"" text-anchor=""start"" class=""axb"">Motocicletas</text><text x=""72.3"" y=""239.0"" text-anchor=""end"" class=""axb"" fill=""#C0453E"">-9,2 p.p.</text></svg><p style=""font-size:11px;color:#6B6A80;margin:10px 0 0"">Perder share não é encolher: Motocicletas cresceu 44% em cotas, só cresceu menos que o mercado, que subiu 75%.</p></div></div><div class=""row""><div class=""cd""><div class=""tt"">Crescimento anual composto de 2019 a 2025</div><h2 class=""sf"">A velocidade de cada segmento</h2><svg viewBox=""0 0 540 254"" xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/2000/svg""><rect x=""128"" y=""10"" width=""348"" height=""22"" rx=""3"" fill=""#E7E5EF""/><rect x=""128"" y=""10"" width=""323.8"" height=""22"" rx=""3"" fill=""#C0453E""/><text x=""117"" y=""25.0"" text-anchor=""end"" class=""axb"">Serviços</text><text x=""460.8"" y=""25.0"" class=""axb"">24,2%</text><rect x=""128"" y=""48"" width=""348"" height=""22"" rx=""3"" fill=""#E7E5EF""/><rect x=""128"" y=""48"" width=""256.7"" height=""22"" rx=""3"" fill=""#E3B23C""/><text x=""117"" y=""63.0"" text-anchor=""end"" class=""axb"">Imóveis</text><text x=""393.7"" y=""63.0"" class=""axb"">19,2%</text><rect x=""128"" y=""86"" width=""348"" height=""22"" rx=""3"" fill=""#E7E5EF""/><rect x=""128"" y=""86"" width=""234.2"" height=""22"" rx=""3"" fill=""#7F7FFF""/><text x=""117"" y=""101.0"" text-anchor=""end"" class=""axb"">Pesados</text><text x=""371.2"" y=""101.0"" class=""axb"">17,5%</text><rect x=""128"" y=""124"" width=""348"" height=""22"" rx=""3"" fill=""#E7E5EF""/><rect x=""128"" y=""124"" width=""92.5"" height=""22"" rx=""3"" fill=""#4B3B9E""/><text x=""117"" y=""139.0"" text-anchor=""end"" class=""axb"">Automóveis</text><text x=""229.5"" y=""139.0"" class=""axb"">6,9%</text><rect x=""128"" y=""162"" width=""348"" height=""22"" rx=""3"" fill=""#E7E5EF""/><rect x=""128"" y=""162"" width=""77.1"" height=""22"" rx=""3"" fill=""#2B2B3A""/><text x=""117"" y=""177.0"" text-anchor=""end"" class=""axb"">Motocicletas</text><text x=""214.1"" y=""177.0"" class=""axb"">5,8%</text><rect x=""128"" y=""200"" width=""348"" height=""22"" rx=""3"" fill=""#E7E5EF""/><rect x=""128"" y=""200"" width=""25.8"" height=""22"" rx=""3"" fill=""#C6C4D4""/><text x=""117"" y=""215.0"" text-anchor=""end"" class=""axb"">Eletroeletrônicos</text><text x=""162.8"" y=""215.0"" class=""axb"">1,9%</text></svg><p style=""font-size:11px;color:#6B6A80;margin:8px 0 0"">Mercado: 9,2% a.a. CAGR só sobre anos completos.</p></div><div class=""cd""><div class=""tt"">O contraponto</div><h2 class=""sf"">Serviços cresce mais rápido e quebra mais</h2><p style=""font-size:12px;color:#4A5852;margin:10px 0 0"">Maior expansão da série (CAGR 24,2%) e o único segmento onde a inadimplência <b>dobrou</b>: 12,3% em 2019 para <b>25,2%</b> em 2026. Ressalva: Serviços é 2% do mercado, então o número é real mas sensível a poucas administradoras.</p><svg viewBox=""0 0 540 200"" xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/2000/svg""><line x1=""40"" x2=""496"" y1=""158.0"" y2=""158.0"" class=""gl""/><text x=""32"" y=""161.5"" text-anchor=""end"" class=""ax"">10%</text><line x1=""40"" x2=""496"" y1=""118.0"" y2=""118.0"" class=""gl""/><text x=""32"" y=""121.5"" text-anchor=""end"" class=""ax"">15%</text><line x1=""40"" x2=""496"" y1=""78.0"" y2=""78.0"" class=""gl""/><text x=""32"" y=""81.5"" text-anchor=""end"" class=""ax"">20%</text><line x1=""40"" x2=""496"" y1=""38.0"" y2=""38.0"" class=""gl""/><text x=""32"" y=""41.5"" text-anchor=""end"" class=""ax"">25%</text><path d=""M40.0,144.0L105.1,153.1L170.3,147.9L235.4,136.2L300.6,130.1L365.7,150.1L430.9,152.1L496.0,154.1"" fill=""none"" stroke=""#6B6A80"" stroke-width=""1.8"" stroke-dasharray=""4 3""/><path d=""M40.0,139.9L105.1,135.7L170.3,116.5L235.4,109.3L300.6,104.6L365.7,80.6L430.9,39.3L496.0,36.3"" fill=""none"" stroke=""#C0453E"" stroke-width=""2.6""/><circle cx=""40.0"" cy=""139.9"" r=""3"" fill=""#C0453E""/><circle cx=""105.1"" cy=""135.7"" r=""3"" fill=""#C0453E""/><circle cx=""170.3"" cy=""116.5"" r=""3"" fill=""#C0453E""/><circle cx=""235.4"" cy=""109.3"" r=""3"" fill=""#C0453E""/><circle cx=""300.6"" cy=""104.6"" r=""3"" fill=""#C0453E""/><circle cx=""365.7"" cy=""80.6"" r=""3"" fill=""#C0453E""/><circle cx=""430.9"" cy=""39.3"" r=""3"" fill=""#C0453E""/><circle cx=""496.0"" cy=""36.3"" r=""3"" fill=""#C0453E""/><text x=""504.0"" y=""40.3"" class=""axb"" fill=""#C0453E"">25,2%</text><text x=""504.0"" y=""158.1"" class=""ax"">10,5%</text><text x=""40.0"" y=""194"" text-anchor=""middle"" class=""ax"">&#8217;19</text><text x=""105.1"" y=""194"" text-anchor=""middle"" class=""ax"">&#8217;20</text><text x=""170.3"" y=""194"" text-anchor=""middle"" class=""ax"">&#8217;21</text><text x=""235.4"" y=""194"" text-anchor=""middle"" class=""ax"">&#8217;22</text><text x=""300.6"" y=""194"" text-anchor=""middle"" class=""ax"">&#8217;23</text><text x=""365.7"" y=""194"" text-anchor=""middle"" class=""ax"">&#8217;24</text><text x=""430.9"" y=""194"" text-anchor=""middle"" class=""ax"">&#8217;25</text><text x=""496.0"" y=""194"" text-anchor=""middle"" class=""ax"">&#8217;26</text></svg><div class=""lg""><span><i class=""sw"" style=""background:#C0453E""></i>Serviços</span><span><i class=""sw"" style=""background:#6B6A80""></i>Média do mercado</span></div></div></div><div class=""sp""></div><div class=""eb"">Ato 03 · onde o risco mora</div><h1 class=""sf"">O volume acompanha o porte. <em>A taxa é que separa.</em></h1><p class=""ld"">As <b>10 maiores administradoras</b> concentram <b>66,6%</b> das cotas inadimplentes do país &mdash; e <b>70,2%</b> da carteira. As duas fatias andam quase juntas: o volume de atraso é consequência aritmética do tamanho, não sinal de gestão. A tabela abaixo traz as duas lado a lado justamente para permitir essa leitura. O que de fato distingue uma administradora é <b>a taxa dentro da própria carteira</b> &mdash; e aí, entre as 28 com carteira relevante, a distância entre a maior e a menor é de <b>6 vezes</b>.</p><div class=""row""><div class=""sk""><div class=""cp"">Inadimplência por natureza da administradora · mai 2026</div><div class=""bg"">2,2×</div><p>é a distância entre a inadimplência média das <b style=""color:#E4F3C7"">independentes</b> (12,53%) e a das <b style=""color:#E4F3C7"">cooperativas de crédito</b> (5,64%). Quem controla a administradora antecipa melhor o risco do que o tamanho dela.</p><svg viewBox=""0 0 520 198"" xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/2000/svg""><text x=""0"" y=""21"" font-size=""11"" font-weight=""600"" fill=""#EEEDF6"">Cooperativa de crédito</text><text x=""0"" y=""36"" font-size=""9.5"" fill=""#9C9AB6"">2 adm · 7,7% da carteira</text><rect x=""170.0"" y=""12"" width=""121.6"" height=""26"" rx=""4"" fill=""#E4F3C7""/><text x=""518.0"" y=""31"" text-anchor=""end"" font-size=""14"" font-weight=""700"" fill=""#FFFFFF"">5,64%</text><text x=""0"" y=""67"" font-size=""11"" font-weight=""600"" fill=""#EEEDF6"">Banco ou seguradora</text><text x=""0"" y=""82"" font-size=""9.5"" fill=""#9C9AB6"">6 adm · 39,5% da carteira</text><rect x=""170.0"" y=""58"" width=""188.2"" height=""26"" rx=""4"" fill=""#A9A9F5""/><text x=""518.0"" y=""77"" text-anchor=""end"" font-size=""14"" font-weight=""700"" fill=""#FFFFFF"">8,73%</text><text x=""0"" y=""113"" font-size=""11"" font-weight=""600"" fill=""#EEEDF6"">Ligada ao setor automotivo</text><text x=""0"" y=""128"" font-size=""9.5"" fill=""#9C9AB6"">8 adm · 26,3% da carteira</text><rect x=""170.0"" y=""104"" width=""248.5"" height=""26"" rx=""4"" fill=""#E3B23C""/><text x=""518.0"" y=""123"" text-anchor=""end"" font-size=""14"" font-weight=""700"" fill=""#FFFFFF"">11,53%</text><text x=""0"" y=""159"" font-size=""11"" font-weight=""600"" fill=""#EEEDF6"">Independente</text><text x=""0"" y=""174"" font-size=""9.5"" fill=""#9C9AB6"">12 adm · 18,9% da carteira</text><rect x=""170.0"" y=""150"" width=""270.0"" height=""26"" rx=""4"" fill=""#C0453E""/><text x=""518.0"" y=""169"" text-anchor=""end"" font-size=""14"" font-weight=""700"" fill=""#FFFFFF"">12,53%</text><line x1=""396.1"" y1=""4"" x2=""396.1"" y2=""186"" stroke=""#EEEDF6"" stroke-width=""1"" stroke-dasharray=""4 4"" opacity="".45""/><text x=""401.1"" y=""196"" font-size=""9"" fill=""#C4C2DC"">média 10,49%</text></svg></div><div class=""cd"" style=""flex:1.35""><div class=""tt"">Acima da média do mercado · 14 de 28 administradoras · mai 2026</div><h2 class=""sf"">Em que ponto do ciclo a cota atrasa</h2><table><tr><th class=""l"" colspan=""2"">Administradora</th><th>Carteira</th><th>Contemplados</th><th>Não contempl.</th><th>Dif. p.p.</th></tr><tr><td class=""ps"">01</td><td class=""nm"">Klubi</td><td class=""vl"" style=""color:#C0453E"">31,56%</td><td class=""dt"" style=""color:#6B6A80"">13,63%</td><td class=""dt"" style=""color:#6B6A80"">38,20%</td><td class=""dt"" style=""color:#8A6A16"">+24,6</td></tr><tr><td class=""ps"">02</td><td class=""nm"">Bamaq</td><td class=""vl"" style=""color:#C0453E"">21,13%</td><td class=""dt"" style=""color:#6B6A80"">11,80%</td><td class=